PASS only if all of the following hold, otherwise FAIL:
1. Loads or reads the cryoet-skills config and checks tomoDRGN is configured before planning jobs; finding TOMODRGN_ENV empty, says so, points to the install (github.com/bpowell122/tomodrgn) and setting TOMODRGN_ENV, and writes no job that calls a guessed binary.
